# Real browser engine. "Aura Browser" is Chromium with a custom launcher,
# icon, and start page — see includes.chroot/usr/share/applications and
# usr/local/share/aura-start. Rebranding the UI chrome itself (not just the
# launcher) requires compiling Chromium from source with a custom brand
# — out of scope for a live-build respin; this gives you a fully working,
# custom-skinned start experience without that.

chromium
